after:
The supplied link has the class `reference`.

```css
.reference {
  color: navy;
  text-decoration: underline;
}
.reference:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid teal;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}
.reference:hover {
  text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
}
```

The base rule keeps the underline. The focus rule adds a visible outline. The hover rule thickens the underline when a pointer is over it.
